// CODING vertical — given an owner/repo, Orbital fetches that repo's live open issues
// (GitHub). Complements repo-brief.taxi (repo facts) with the actual open work items.
// The /issues endpoint also returns PRs; those carry a "pull_request" node upstream.
given { owner : brain.RepoOwner = "orbitalapi", repo : brain.RepoName = "orbital" }
find { coding.GithubIssue[] }
